# The app build (apps/web/Dockerfile, context = repo root) reads THIS file,
# not the root .dockerignore: a Dockerfile-specific ignore file replaces it.
# Patterns are relative to the context root, so keep the `**/` prefixes.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env
**/.env.*
# TypeScript's incremental cache: a local `next dev` or `tsc` run leaves it
# describing files that are no longer there, and `next build` in the image
# reuses it and fails type-checking on those paths.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
